`6.17.3 א(14) / ב(12) working by the rules` MEANS
    `the guide must` `working by this takanon, the Ministry's instructions on Shelach guides' work from time to time, and the Gadna activity procedure` "6.17.3א(14), ב(12)"

-- א(15) / ב(13): a guide who wants to move district applies in writing by
-- the end of May of that year. Time in days to the end of May.
-- att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a__cls_15, att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_b__cls_13 here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it in words a little its own.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a__cls_15 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_b__cls_13
GIVEN `wants to move to another district` IS A BOOLEAN, `days to the end of May` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.17 party` `6.17 action`
DECIDE `6.17.3 א(15) / ב(13) moving district` `wants to move to another district` `days to the end of May` IS
    IF `wants to move to another district`
    THEN PARTY `the Shelach guide`
         MUST  `perform` done PROVIDED done EQUALS `applying in writing, by the end of May of that year, to move from one district of the Ministry to another`
         WITHIN `days to the end of May`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the Shelach guide` BECAUSE "6.17.3א(15), ב(13): the application is made in writing by the end of May"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ג: notwithstanding ב, a guide whose position is split between two or more
-- institutions has his work coordinated by the supervision with their
-- principals, provided his share of central enterprises is no higher than
-- he would owe at one institution at the same fraction.
-- att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it in words a little its own.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c
GIVEN `the position is split between two or more institutions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.17 party` `6.17 action`
DECIDE `6.17.3ג coordinating a split position` `the position is split between two or more institutions` IS
    IF `the position is split between two or more institutions`
    THEN PARTY `the Shelach supervision`
         MUST  `coordinate the split position's work with the principals of the institutions`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the Shelach supervision` BECAUSE "6.17.3ג"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c
GIVEN `central enterprises asked of the split-position guide` IS A NUMBER, `what he would owe at one institution at the same fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the split-position guide's share of central enterprises is within bounds` `central enterprises asked of the split-position guide` `what he would owe at one institution at the same fraction` IF
    `central enterprises asked of the split-position guide` AT MOST `what he would owe at one institution at the same fraction`

-- ד: a field day lasts 6 hours; the supervision may approve longer days,
-- the guide then going out on fewer field days a month ("לפחות ימי שדה":
-- the proviso fixes the total), provided the month's field-day hours equal
-- the monthly quota.
-- att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_a here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it, where this scan has words it cannot read.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_a
`hours in a field day` MEANS 6

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_a
GIVEN `the supervision approved longer days` IS A BOOLEAN, `hours per field day` IS A NUMBER, `field days in the month` IS A NUMBER, `monthly quota` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the month's field days are in order` `the supervision approved longer days` `hours per field day` `field days in the month` `monthly quota` IF
    IF `the supervision approved longer days`
    THEN `hours per field day` TIMES `field days in the month` EQUALS `monthly quota`
    ELSE `hours per field day` EQUALS `hours in a field day`




-- As the takanon's §6.17.4 (קביעות) groups them:

-- att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_a__cls_1, att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_a__cls_2 here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it, where this scan has words it cannot read.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_a__cls_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_a__cls_2
GIVEN g IS A `Shelach guide`, `years of probation` IS A NUMBER, `consecutive years actually worked` IS A NUMBER, `found fit for tenure by the supervision` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to tenure` g `years of probation` `consecutive years actually worked` `found fit for tenure by the supervision` IF
        `found fit for tenure by the supervision`
    AND (   (    (g's `grade` EQUALS `certified Shelach guide` OR g's `grade` EQUALS `certified teacher or higher`)
             AND `years of probation` AT LEAST 2
             AND `years of probation` AT MOST 4)
         OR `consecutive years actually worked` AT LEAST 5)

-- (א), last sentence: where the probation is extended, the Ministry tells
-- the guide in writing ahead of the third or fourth year. Time in months
-- from the start of the probation year that is ending.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_a__cls_1
GIVEN `the probation is extended` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.17 party` `6.17 action`
DECIDE `notice of an extended probation` `the probation is extended` IS
    IF `the probation is extended`
    THEN PARTY `the Ministry`
         MUST  `notify the guide in writing of an extended probation`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry` BECAUSE "section 6.17.4(א): an extended probation is notified in writing ahead of the third or fourth year"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- As the takanon's §6.17.5 (דרגה וותק) groups them:

-- att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_i here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it in words a little its own.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_i
`the scale a Shelach guide is paid on` MEANS "the salary grades customary for teaching staff in official primary institutions, within the Compulsory Education Law, 1949"

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN g IS A `Shelach guide`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.17 party` `6.17 action`
DECIDE `6.17.5 2א supplementary exams` g IS
    IF g's `grade` EQUALS `certified Shelach guide`
    THEN PARTY `the Shelach guide`
         MUST  `take the supplementary exams set for certified Shelach guides`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the Shelach guide` BECAUSE "6.17.5 2א"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_a__subpara_2 here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it in words a little its own.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN `consecutive years actually worked` IS A NUMBER, `passed the Shelach guides' seminar` IS A BOOLEAN, `recommended by the supervision` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may take the "Shelach and its teaching" supplementary exams without attending the seminar` `consecutive years actually worked` `passed the Shelach guides' seminar` `recommended by the supervision` IF
        `consecutive years actually worked` AT LEAST 2
    AND (NOT `passed the Shelach guides' seminar`)
    AND `recommended by the supervision`

-- (3): "considered a certified Shelach guide" are (א) and (ב). (ב) says a
-- guide of 10–11 years' schooling "owes" the 1962 booklet's exams; read
-- with (4), which grades by how many of them are left, the guide who has
-- passed them all is certified (F-6.17-f).
-- att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_b__subpara_2 here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it, where this scan has words it cannot read.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN s IS A `guide schooling`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a certified Shelach guide` s IF
       `meets (3)א` s
    OR (    `owes the 1962 booklet's exams` s
        AND s's `exams of the 1962 booklet still owed` EQUALS 0)

GIVEN s IS A `guide schooling`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets (3)א` s IF
        (s's `has a Hebrew matriculation certificate` OR s's `years of schooling` AT LEAST 12)
    AND s's `finished the Gadna guides' seminar`
    AND s's `passed Gadna and its teaching`
    AND s's `passed psychology`
    AND s's `passed Hebrew language`
    AND s's `positive supervision assessment for a year or more`

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN s IS A `guide schooling`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owes the 1962 booklet's exams` s IF
    s's `years of schooling` AT LEAST 10 AND s's `years of schooling` AT MOST 11

-- F-6.17-f's evidence: an 11-year guide who has passed every exam the
-- booklet asks of him, but meets nothing in (א), is certified on this
-- reading and not on the other.
`an 11-year guide who passed every booklet exam` MEANS
    `guide schooling` WITH
        `years of schooling`                     IS 11
        `has a Hebrew matriculation certificate` IS FALSE
        `finished the Gadna guides' seminar`     IS FALSE
        `passed Gadna and its teaching`          IS FALSE
        `passed Shelach and its teaching`        IS TRUE
        `passed psychology`                      IS TRUE
        `passed Hebrew language`                 IS TRUE
        `positive supervision assessment for a year or more` IS FALSE
        `exams of the 1962 booklet still owed`   IS 0
        `the one exam owed is Shelach and its teaching` IS FALSE

-- att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d/p2, att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d__subpara_2, att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d__subpara_3, att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d__subpara_4 here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it in words a little its own.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d__subpara_2 akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d__subpara_3 akn:att_1__hc_1__hc_1__para_d__subpara_4
GIVEN s IS A `guide schooling`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is non-certified A` s IF
       s's `has a Hebrew matriculation certificate`
    OR (s's `years of schooling` AT LEAST 12 AND s's `passed Shelach and its teaching`)
    OR (    s's `years of schooling` EQUALS 11
        AND s's `passed Shelach and its teaching`
        AND (s's `passed psychology` OR s's `passed Hebrew language`))
    OR (    s's `years of schooling` EQUALS 10
        AND s's `passed Shelach and its teaching`
        AND s's `passed psychology`
        AND s's `passed Hebrew language`)

-- att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_h__cls_1 here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it, where this scan has words it cannot read.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_h__cls_1
GIVEN `completed the exams his schooling and the supplementary exams he passed require` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a certified guide may move to the certified teacher's grade` `completed the exams his schooling and the supplementary exams he passed require` IF
    `completed the exams his schooling and the supplementary exams he passed require`

-- att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_h__cls_2 here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it, where this scan has words it cannot read.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_h__cls_2
GIVEN `passed the exams his schooling and the non-certified teachers' supplementary exams require` IS A BOOLEAN, `years of actual guiding` IS A NUMBER, `positive supervision assessment after them` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a non-certified guide is certified as a teacher` `passed the exams his schooling and the non-certified teachers' supplementary exams require` `years of actual guiding` `positive supervision assessment after them` IF
        `passed the exams his schooling and the non-certified teachers' supplementary exams require`
    AND `years of actual guiding` AT LEAST 2
    AND `positive supervision assessment after them`

-- As the takanon's §6.17.7 (תוספות וקצובות) groups them:

-- att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_kb here, against the takanon's §6.17's words: the takanon restates it in words a little its own.
